@startuml
title State Chart: ExamAttempt (Online Examination System)
[*] --> Registered : student enrols / create attempt record
Registered : entry\n/ create attempt record
InProgress : entry\n/ start timer
InProgress : do\n/ accept and save answers
InProgress : exit\n/ stop timer
Disconnected : do\n/ keep timer running
Submitted : entry\n/ lock answers
Evaluating : entry\n/ auto-grade objective answers
Evaluated : entry\n/ compute total, set pass or fail
Published : entry\n/ notify student
UnderReview : do\n/ re-mark disputed answers
Terminated : entry\n/ flag attempt

Registered --> InProgress : startExam\n[window open]\n/ load paper
Registered --> Expired : windowClosed\n[not started]
InProgress --> InProgress : answerSaved\n/ save answer
InProgress --> Disconnected : connectionLost
Disconnected --> InProgress : reconnect\n[time left]\n/ resume
Disconnected --> Submitted : timeUp\n/ auto-submit saved answers
InProgress --> Submitted : submit\n/ lock answers
InProgress --> Submitted : timeUp\n/ auto-submit saved answers
InProgress --> Terminated : malpracticeDetected\n/ lock answers, flag attempt
Submitted --> Evaluating : evaluationStarted\n/ auto-grade objective
Evaluating --> Evaluated : allMarksEntered\n[objective and descriptive done]\n/ compute total, set pass or fail
Evaluated --> Published : resultReleased\n/ notify student
Published --> UnderReview : recheckRequested\n[within 7 days]
UnderReview --> Published : recheckCompleted\n/ update marks, notify student
Published --> [*] : archived\n[retention period over]
Expired --> [*]
Terminated --> [*]
@enduml
